{"reviewId": "44817347_820kQSYuY", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "但是气候变化对上文中世界资源品中，仅有农业产品有较大的影响。其余工业原料，贵金属等受其影响应该较小，再加上农业产品尤其粮食作物的丰富度比较高，单一品类的价格涨跌对于人民生活的压力应该没有很大。（当然，这是我生活在中国这种即使物价上涨也相对温和，并且公共事业费用相对较低的国家，所以才有这种体感。第三世界国家，甚至疫情后的欧洲似乎生活必需品的价格上涨比较剧烈。）", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "因为太阳黑子的变化导致了气候变化，从而导致初级产品价格波动。现在看来，这个分支对研究农业和石油的价格波动具有重要意义。", "range": "7374-7433", "reviewId": "44817347_820kQSYuY", "userVid": 44817347, "topics": [], "createTime": 1753783178, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 44817347, "name": "S.X", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-5iWRbrUBQ~gkYWMLKY_DKf9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "S.X", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 909829830, "name": "东隅非晚", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ccd2hNFKTGxRUn4N3nRDdTNTiaAn42biatTI51rmuMVc04rn4yFWD2KdREwqK08AjVFRMwITo7HIk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "东隅非晚", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "时不我待", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-200", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 200}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "体感确实不太一样。粮价是物价的基石，我们有国家调控，一直在稳定这个基础，包括农产品。资本主义国家可不管这些，看看日本的米价就知道了", "reviewId": "44817347_820kQSYuY", "